athroom.\nThird floor: 1 bedroom that can also be used as an office, along with a toilet.\nBasement: Home cinema and ‌2 ‌additional ‌bedrooms.\n\nDon’t ‌miss ‌your ‌chance to ‌own this ‌prime beachside property in one ‌of ‌Marbella’s ‌most ‌sought-after ‌locations.\n\nContact us today to ‌arrange ‌a ‌private ‌viewing!\n\nLET ‌US ‌MOVE ‌YOU!"},"features":{"es":["Ciudad","Lado de la Playa","Puerto","Cerca de Puerto","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Cerca de los Bosques","Cerca de Marina","Urbanización","Este","Sureste","Sur","Suroeste","Oeste","Excelente","Privada","Con Calefacción","Aire Acondicionado","A/A Preinstalado","A/A Caliente","A/A Frio","Calefacción Central.","Chimenea","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","WiFi","Gimnasio","Sala de Juegos","Trastero","Lavadero","Baño En-Suite","Suelo de Madera","Suelos de Mármol","Barbacoa","Doble acristalamiento","Sótano","Fibra óptica","Amueblada","Equipada","Privado","Persianas Eléctricas","Alarma","Caja fuerte","Cubierto","Más de uno","Privado","Electricidad","Ganga","Frente a la playa","Casas de vacaciónes","Inversion","Lujo","Reventa","Contemporáneo"],"en":["Town","Beachside","Port","Close To Port","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","Close To Schools","Close To Forest","Close To Marina","Urbanisation","East","South East","South","South West","West","Excellent","Private","Heated","Air Conditioning","Pre Installed A/C","Hot A/C","Cold A/C","Central Heating","Fireplace","Garden","Pool","Covered Terrace","Fitted Wardrobes","Near Transport","Private Terrace","WiFi","Gym","Games Room","Storage Room","Utility Room","Ensuite Bathroom","Wood Flooring","Marble Flooring","Barbeque","Double Glazing","Basement","Fiber Optic","Fully Furnished","Fully Fitted","Private","Electric Blinds","Alarm System","Safe","Covered","More Than One","Private","Electricity","Bargain","Beachfront","Holiday Homes","Investment","Luxury"